would make coke again\n", "timestamp_created": 1450914947, "timestamp_updated": 1450914947, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.463576167821884155", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19891290", "author": {"steamid": "76561198174831678", "personaname": "rubthefruit", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rubthefruit/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 66015, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 36820, "last_played": 1747271915, "avatar": "2b51bdcb5f4d059366c69cd11cb3e4726f296788"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really love the arma series, its one of my favorite game series, and arma 3 is no exception. Arma 3 shows what PCs are really capable of doing. If youre not into millitary simulators and want to rp then arma is also the best choice for that, there are hundreds of packs rp servers. Arma 3 has greatly improved graphicly and improved with a better engine but it lacks many the amount of vehicles arma 2 had, arma 3 has about half of these. Arma 3 has a great campaign which i enjoyed greatly. If you look at the other reviews its just people ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ about not being able to run it on ultra at 60 fps, but what do you expect on a game this massive and realistic, i have a ♥♥♥♥♥♥ i5 and an ok gpu and i can run the game at 60 fps on high.\n\nTLDR: Arma 3 has improved graphics and physics but less stuff than arma 2, but is a most have for any pc gamer", "timestamp_created": 1450914899, "timestamp_updated": 1450914899, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_st